---
// Features — 3-col DS spec: Alumno, Docente, Apoderado
---

<section id="caracteristicas" class="bg-[var(--bg-subtle)] py-20 md:py-28">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 md:px-8 lg:px-10">
    <!-- Section header -->
    <div class="mx-auto mb-14 max-w-2xl text-center">
      <p class="mb-3 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[var(--sky-600)]">
        Funcionalidades
      </p>
      <h2 class="t-display-3 text-[var(--slate-800)]">
        Una plataforma, tres experiencias
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 t-body text-[var(--fg-2)]">
        Diseñada para que cada actor de la comunidad escolar tenga la información que necesita, cuando la necesita.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Feature grid — 3 cols DS spec -->
    <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
      <!-- Alumno -->
      <article class="card group relative overflow-hidden" style="background: var(--sky-50); border-color: var(--sky-100);">
        <div class="mb-4 flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl" style="background: var(--sky-100);">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="var(--sky-700)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M2 3h6a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v14a3 3 0 0 0-3-3H2z"/>
            <path d="M22 3h-6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v14a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h7z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="t-h2 mb-2 text-[var(--fg-on-sky)]">Práctica inteligente</h3>
        <p class="t-body-sm text-[var(--sky-800)]">El sistema adapta los ejercicios al nivel del estudiante. Feedback inmediato sin punición.</p>
        <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 h-0.5 w-0 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:w-full" style="background: var(--sky-400);"></div>
      </article>

      <!-- Docente -->
      <article class="card group relative overflow-hidden" style="background: var(--bg); border-color: var(--slate-100);">
        <div class="mb-4 flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl" style="background: var(--slate-100);">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="var(--slate-700)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M3 3v18h18"/>
            <path d="M7 16V9M12 16V5M17 16v-4"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="t-h2 mb-2 text-[var(--fg-1)]">Dashboard por habilidad</h3>
        <p class="t-body-sm text-[var(--fg-2)]">Heatmap de dominio por alumno y skill. Alertas automáticas cuando alguien baja de 0.4.</p>
        <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 h-0.5 w-0 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:w-full" style="background: var(--slate-400);"></div>
      </article>

      <!-- Apoderado -->
      <article class="card group relative overflow-hidden" style="background: var(--mint-50); border-color: var(--mint-100);">
        <div class="mb-4 flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl" style="background: var(--mint-100);">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="var(--mint-700)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/>
            <circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/>
            <path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/>
            <path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="t-h2 mb-2 text-[var(--fg-on-mint)]">Resumen semanal</h3>
        <p class="t-body-sm text-[var(--mint-800)]">Tu hijo va bien en sumas. Esta semana practicó 4 días. Sin números crudos, solo claridad.</p>
        <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 h-0.5 w-0 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:w-full" style="background: var(--mint-400);"></div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
